### Webhooks (needs accessToken, storeId). Locally, run with WEBHOOKS_REQUIRE_HTTPS=false WEBHOOKS_ALLOWED_PRIVATE_CIDRS=127.0.0.0/8
### and a receiver, e.g. the reference verifier in docs/api/webhooks.md listening on 127.0.0.1:9098.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@subscriptionId = PASTE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID
@deliveryId = PASTE_DELIVERY_ID

### Subscribe (the response contains the secret ONCE)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"url": "http://127.0.0.1:9098/webhooks", "topics": ["orders/create", "orders/paid", "inventory_levels/update"]}

### SSRF attempt: refused with 422 webhook_url_not_allowed
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"url": "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/", "topics": ["orders/create"]}

### Delivery history (filter: status=PENDING|RETRYING|SUCCEEDED|DEAD|PAUSED|DISCARDED)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### One delivery with its attempts (status code, duration, error, response excerpt)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Replay one delivery (same event id)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/replay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Re-activate after a pause, then replay everything parked or dead since a time
PATCH {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "ACTIVE"}

###
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/replays
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"statuses": ["PAUSED", "DEAD"], "since": "2026-10-08T00:00:00Z"}

### Rotate the secret (old one keeps signing for 24 h)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/secret-rotation
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
